      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey u think it's possible that companies like nike or adidas are using the sensors in those high-end smart shoes to track more than just steps? like i've been reading about how gait analysis and heart rate patterns can be used to build a psychological profile and i feel like they're doing it covertly to harvest data on us. is there any actual info or leaks about programs like that?",
